# Line endings stay LF on every system: shell scripts, the Caddyfile and SQL run inside Linux containers, and Git for
# Windows would otherwise check them out with CRLF (a CRLF entrypoint.sh stops the gateway from starting).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
